The resulting positioning isn’t merely “Untappd for everything.”

It’s much bigger:

Beverage Goblin

Your taste in drinks.

And underneath it is essentially a beverage taste graph + social network + recommendation engine + commerce layer.

The brilliant part of the Spotify model here is that the first version can be genuinely useful and fun before Beverage Goblin owns inventory, warehouses, delivery, or a single beverage. Once it knows what people want to drink, then you progressively move downstream into the transaction.